<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<CustomMetadata xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" fqn="CustomDetector__mdt.ARM_008">
    <label>ARM-008</label>
    <protected>false</protected>
    <values><field>DetectorId__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">ARM-008</value></values>
    <values><field>Label__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Decision tables not Active</value></values>
    <values><field>Category__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">governance</value></values>
    <values><field>AppliesTo__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">ARM</value></values>
    <values><field>SoqlQuery__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">SELECT Id, MasterLabel, Status FROM DecisionTable WHERE Status != 'Active'</value></values>
    <values><field>TitleTemplate__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Decision table &quot;{MasterLabel}&quot; status is {Status}</value></values>
    <values><field>DescriptionTemplate__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Decision tables in Draft/Inactive status will not be evaluated by the engine.</value></values>
    <values><field>PrimaryRecordIdField__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Id</value></values>
    <values><field>PrimaryRecordType__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">DecisionTable</value></values>
    <values><field>EntitledUsdField__c</field><value xsi:nil="true"/></values>
    <values><field>RealizedUsdField__c</field><value xsi:nil="true"/></values>
    <values><field>IsActive__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:boolean">true</value></values>
    <values><field>Version__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:double">1</value></values>
    <values><field>Effort__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">low</value></values>
    <values><field>RecoverabilityScore__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:double">0.9</value></values>
    <values><field>Severity__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Warning</value></values>
    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: DecisionTable records whose Status is anything other than &apos;Active&apos; (Draft, Inactive, etc).
Why it matters: ARM pricing procedures route through decision tables; non-active tables get skipped at runtime, so pricing branches you think are wired up silently fall through to defaults. Customers see fallback prices rather than the negotiated tier.
Suppress a finding: for decision tables intentionally parked in Draft pending a contract negotiation that finance hasn&apos;t signed off on yet.
Disable the detector: only if your ARM org uses pricing procedures without decision tables — rare; most Revenue Cloud configurations rely on them for tiered pricing.</value></values>
</CustomMetadata>
